Oz: the remade effects (ENGINE_PLAN.md P3), cg_fxStyle 0|1, in cg_oz_fx.c: sparks off impacts; with
the Graphics settings (the oz_graphics_* cvars) layered blasts (a flash that lights the room, a brighter
fireball, lingering flames, embers, smoke lit by the fire) and a glow on energy hits, the rail's glow,
Quake Live and core styles, the lightning beam's glow, glowing missile trails and heavy blood; the
lightning gun's burn lines (marks that cool from white-hot to a scorch) in place of its bullet holes;
Audio > Hit sound pitched by the damage the server's "dmg" commands report. Local entities up to 4096.

